id: SEC-042
title: OWASP Top 10 — A07 Auth Failures + A09 Logging Failures + A10 SSRF/Error Handling
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .tsx .jsx .py .java .go .cpp .h
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ vendor/ _test.go
patterns:
  - regex: password\s*=\s*\"
    message: "A07 Hardcoded password — use environment variables or a secrets manager"
  - regex: password:\s*\"
    message: "A07 Hardcoded password — use environment variables or a secrets manager"
  - regex: jwt\.decode
    message: "A07 JWT decoded without verification — use jwt.verify() to validate signature"
  - regex: algorithm:\s*'none'
    message: "A07 JWT algorithm none — disables signature verification, allowing token forgery"
  - regex: expiresIn:\s*'365d'
    message: "A07 Long-lived token (365d) — use short expiry with refresh tokens"
  - regex: catch\s*\{\}
    message: "A09 Empty catch block — swallowed errors hide failures and make debugging impossible"
  - regex: catch\s*\([a-zA-Z_]+\)\s*\{\}
    message: "A09 Empty catch block — log or handle the error, don't swallow it"
  - regex: except:\s*$
    message: "A09 Bare except in Python — catches KeyboardInterrupt and SystemExit. Use except Exception"
  - regex: catch\s*\(Exception\s+[a-zA-Z_]+\)
    message: "A10 Catch-all Exception — catch specific exceptions to avoid masking bugs"
  - regex: catch\s*\(Throwable
    message: "A10 Catch-all Throwable — catches OutOfMemoryError and other fatal errors. Catch specific types"
fix: Store secrets in environment variables or vaults. Verify JWT signatures. Use short token expiry. Handle errors explicitly — never swallow them. Catch specific exception types.
